# Local-First Ed App Project Standards

## Tech Stack Versions

- **Framework**: [TanStack Start](https://tanstack.com/start) (Full-stack React)
- **Routing**: [TanStack Router](https://tanstack.com/router) (File-based in `src/routes`)
- **Data Fetching**: [TanStack Query](https://tanstack.com/query) v5+
- **UI Architecture**: React 19 + Shadcn UI + [Base UI](https://base-ui.com)
- **Styling**: [Tailwind CSS v4](https://tailwindcss.com) (Modern engine)
- **Forms**: [TanStack Form](https://tanstack.com/form) (using `standardSchemaValidator`)
- **Database**: Drizzle ORM + Cloudflare D1 (SQLite)
- **Auth**: [Better Auth](https://better-auth.com) v1.5+
- **Tooling**: [Biome](https://biomejs.dev) (Linting & Formatting)
- **Offline/Sync**: `idb-keyval` + Workbox (PWA)

## Architectural Principles

- **Local-First Consistency**: **ALWAYS** prioritize offline-ready data structures. Use `uuidv7` for primary keys to ensure collision-free sync.
- **Server Functions**: Use `createServerFn` for all data mutations and sensitive logic. Reference `src/features/[module]/server/` for organization.
- **Vertical Slice Architecture**: Organize complex domains in `src/features/<feature-name>`.
  - Structure: `components/`, `server/`, `types/`, `utils/`, `*.queries.ts`, `*.schema.ts`.
- **Type Safety**: **NEVER** use `any`. Use strict Zod schemas (v4+) for all API inputs/outputs and form validations.
- **Exports**: **ALWAYS** use **Named Exports** (`export function MyComponent`) for everything. **NEVER** use default exports.
- **Imports**: **ALWAYS** use project-relative imports with prefix `#/` (e.g., `#/features/auth/types`).

## UI & Design Principles

- **Aesthetic Excellence**: Follow the [frontend.mdc](file:///.cursor/rules/frontend.mdc) for all UI work to ensure "WOW" factor.
- **Tailwind v4**: **ALWAYS** use Tailwind v4 utility classes. Define variables in `src/styles.css` using `@theme`.
- **Dynamic Styles**: Use the `cn` helper (`clsx` + `tailwind-merge`) for conditional classes.

## Specialized Patterns

### Data Fetching (TanStack Query)

- **Query Factories**: Define query/mutation options in `src/features/[module]/[module].queries.ts`.
- **Persistence**: Query results are persisted via `idb-keyval` where appropriate for offline support.

### Forms (TanStack Form)

- **Field Pattern**: **ALWAYS** use `<form.AppField>` (nested children) for type inference.
- **Validation**: Use `standardSchemaValidator` with Zod schemas defined in `src/features/[module]/[module].schema.ts`.
- **Refer canonical example**: `src/hooks/use-app-form.tsx`.

## Code Quality & Verification

- **Linting & Formatting**: **ALWAYS** run `pnpm check` before committing. Biome is the source of truth for formatting (Tabs, Double Quotes).
- **Type Safety**: Run `pnpm typecheck` to verify cross-module type integrity.
- **Route Generation**: After adding/modifying routes, ensure `pnpm dev` is running to regenerate `src/routeTree.gen.ts`.

## Rule Delegation

For specific domain patterns, refer to:

- **Frontend & Design**: [frontend.mdc](file:///.cursor/rules/frontend.mdc)
- **Auth**: [better-auth.mdc](file:///.cursor/rules/better-auth.mdc)
- **Feature Modules**: Check for `.mdc` files in `src/features/[module]/.cursor/rules/` (if present).
